# Team Cuban Card vendor export — the raw file stays local, deliberately.
# assets/teamcuban.js (the derived, attributed data we publish) IS committed;
# redistributing their original spreadsheet verbatim in a public repo is a
# separate and larger exposure than publishing the prices, so we don't.
data/sources/teamcuban-medications.*
